silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_01_gate_discipline_sections_03_arrow_typing_contract_concrete_anchor_7#installedbodymassatom silm:hasLongDescription "The InstalledBodyMassAtom is The validated weight atom installed in the profile. The install arrow lands here. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'RuntimeAtom', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
